      "id": "s10",
      "type": "STAT_PANELS",
      "narration": "Here's what the companies using it keep pointing at, and it isn't on any chart: how long it will keep working without you. Ramp left it running on a machine-learning problem for thirty-eight hours unattended. Millennium used it to find the cause of a crash that appeared roughly once in a million runs — one their own engineers hadn't cracked in years.",
